@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE
@postId = 1

### Get Token (copy token from response into the variable above)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/api-token-auth/
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"alice","password":"Demo-Learning-42!"}

### List groups
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/groups/
Authorization: Token {{token}}

### Create a post (copy its id into postId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts/
Authorization: Token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"Hello, Yatube!","group":"cats"}

### List posts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts/
Authorization: Token {{token}}

### Get one post
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts/{{postId}}/
Authorization: Token {{token}}

### Partial update
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts/{{postId}}/
Authorization: Token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"Updated post"}

### Replace fields and clear group
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts/{{postId}}/
Authorization: Token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"Full update","group":null}

### Delete your post
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts/{{postId}}/
Authorization: Token {{token}}

### Expected 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts/
